    "role": "Qliphothic Tyrant (Thaumiel — Lesser)",
    "tier": 1,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>Psychic residue of a tyrant who believed every contradictory whim was law. Two faces on one split head — one whispers grandeur into its own ear while the other barks impossible commands. It gathers husks and rules a patch of the Wastes with nonsensical, brutal edicts.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Thaumiel, the Split Crown — the Hull of Keter. Unity broken into duality and tyranny.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'It argues with itself about how to kill you. Do not wait for them to reach consensus.'</em></p>",
